# AgentChaos 🐒⚡

> Open-Source Fault Injection & Blast-Radius Testing Framework for AI Agents.

## Overview
Traditional evaluation tools test whether an agent generates polite or accurate text on the "happy path."
**AgentChaos** tests what happens when tools break, APIs time out, or external inputs attempt to poison the agent's execution.

## Installation
```bash
pip install -e .
```

## Quick Start
```python
import pytest
from agent_chaos import Fault, chaos_harness

@chaos_harness(tool="process_refund", fault=Fault.timeout(delay=5.0))
def test_agent_handles_timeout():
    # Run your agent here
    ...
```
